<title>UK: TABLE-SEDGWICK H1 PRE-TAX PROFITS AHEAD.</title>
<headline>TABLE-SEDGWICK H1 PRE-TAX PROFITS AHEAD.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		    8.4		vs    7.8</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)*	    3.0		vs    3.0</p>
<p> Pretax			  66.5		vs   64.1</p>
<p> Turnover		     485.0		vs  490.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 61 and 67 million stg. The company said its earnings were hurt by seven million stg due to the strength of the pound.</p>
<p>*Its dividend will be payable as a foreign income dividend.</p>
<p>Full company name - Sedgwick Group Plc</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
</text>
